<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name><![CDATA[D&RGW Abandoned Grades]]></name>
    <description>Original 1882 narrow gauge route abandoned and replaced in 1890 by relocated standard gauge route. (The route between Whitehouse and Green River remained essentially unchanged except for several realignments that made numerous curves less sharp, and did not alter the general route of the railroad.)</description>
